","updated_at":"2021-01-14T17:30:12Z","body":"Thanks @icbaker for the in depth explanation. I can understand that it could be on a low priority due to bit unusual scenario but I will curiously wait for the solution.\r\nI hope it is not harmful anyways !","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/760344346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"GouravSna","id":38206744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjA2NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38206744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna","html_url":"https://github.com/GouravSna","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GouravSna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4207367782,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDIwNzM2Nzc4Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/4207367782","actor":{"login":"icbaker","id":1279752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker","html_url":"https://github.com/icbaker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/fo